# Do not write the keys in this file: it is part of the project, and check.cmd fails if it ever
# holds a value. Make a NEW file named .env next to it (Notepad: File, Save as, "Save as type"
# All files, name .env) with the two lines below, each value right after its = sign, no quotes:
#   the JWT issuer after WEB_EXT_API_KEY=, the JWT secret after WEB_EXT_API_SECRET=
# They come from https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/developers/addon/api/key/
# Then check it with: sign.cmd --keys. Every step: docs\secrets.md, "First time".
WEB_EXT_API_KEY=
WEB_EXT_API_SECRET=
